config APPLE_MBX
	tristate "PowerVR MBX Lite on Apple S5L8720"
	depends on ARCH_S5L87XX || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on DRM
	help
	  PowerVR MBX Lite GPU in the Apple S5L8720 (iPod touch 2nd
	  generation): power-on, reset, GPU MMU, buffer allocation and
	  command submission (2D, 3D blits, tile accelerator frames)
	  through a DRM render node.
